    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by \"letting myself fall\"? like, just give up on the music? it feels like there's no other way to make the noise in my head stop. i just want the version of me that actually mattered to stay intact, instead of watching myself decay. is there really no other way to just... end this version of my life?",
